# Architecture

## Packages

- `apps/web` — Next.js + wagmi/viem on 0G Mainnet
- `apps/api` — NestJS + Postgres + Redis (admin, play, eval, indexer)
- `packages/game-schemas` — shared Zod/TS types
- `packages/sdk` — contracts helpers + 0G Storage/Compute
- `contracts` — Foundry: SekaiAgent (ERC-7857), MissionVault

## 0G stack

- Chain 16661: ownership, fees, commitments, rankings, payouts
- Storage: encrypted agent intel, sealed plays, criteria, evaluations
- Compute: MissionPlay generation + rubric evaluation (TEE preferred)
- ERC-8004 registries for public agent cards

## Roles

ADMIN (mission create/reveal), EVALUATOR_RELAYER (post scores / settle), players (accept/submit).

## Secrets

Never commit `.env` or private keys. Use `.env.example` placeholders only.
